  so the summary lines were cut. Counted from the lines shown: stages, requirements, findings-removed, new-gate-DG7 and new-review
  each show exactly one × (the REQ-S04-008 G6 test) and 29 ✓ lines, EXIT 1; none and candidates show 'Tests 31 passed (31)', EXIT 0.
- The EXIT 1 lines are by design: these mutants must be killed. 'candidates' passing is by design: candidates/ is outside
  DELIVERY_RECORDS (D-138), and a product G6 approval cannot write there (06b-product-writes-docs-delivery.log).
- Two earlier attempts are kept and NOT used: 06-a08-mutants-attempt1-filtered-INVALID.log (run with -t, which skipped the earlier
  sequential tests, so the G6 submission got 422 gate.out_of_sequence: a harness error of mine) and
